  "description": "Deterministic, serializable time-state calculations: calendar recurrence boundaries (daily/weekly/monthly), half-open time-window arithmetic, elapsed-time cooldown/recharge state with O(1) offline catch-up, and a logical-tick event schedule for simulations. Pure functions of (state, instant/tick) -- never reads the clock. Boundary, daylight-saving, and tick-dispatch rules are fixed versioned contracts. Zero dependencies.",
